docs {
  # Lerniqo API — manual verification

  Run the server against the disposable database, never `.env`:

      set -a && . ./.env.test && set +a
      PORT=3001 npm run start:dev

  Select the `local` environment, then walk `Center Auth` in numbered order.
  Requests chain through environment variables, so order matters.

  Tokens the API would normally email are not returned in responses. Read them
  from the server console, or from the mail provider, and paste them into
  `verificationToken` / `resetCode` before running steps 02 and 08.
}
